{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b6d660c5d4a8de2032d7f3c88425e974e1787d6b3ab0c01932cbbbe997e192ae", "ja": "（翼のPVは、ファンの人達の間で好評みたいだ。\n新しい衣装も、よく似合っているしな！）", "zh": "（翼的PV在粉丝之间似乎获得了好评。\n这也难怪，毕竟新服装很适合她！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bf2d515ab3021c4ba549b216489ab031448a3b341a5a2ee2c84a311ed6f2eda7", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。\nお疲れさまで～す！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n你辛苦了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f1c95f70e6532b77d5d89bc3096b980b859c79ce9ba5faa8c4055a986be18e98", "ja": "お疲れさま、翼……って、\nPVの衣装なんか着て、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "辛苦你了，翼……呃，\n你怎么穿着PV的服装，出了什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5871b920d15b19e9bbd4fa1a8cd1bb3409ea3ad4091a7f02926fc766bf155f4e", "ja": "もー、{$P$}さんってば。\n乙女心がわかってない質問は、ダメですよー？", "zh": "哎唷～{$P$}先生真是的。\n怎么能问这种不懂少女心的问题呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3b02aa4c9d048f15c5f602683b52eade9614920152de6259e79f6d69ecb36b51", "ja": "そ、そうだったのか？　ごめん。\nでも、本当にどうかしたのか？", "zh": "是、是吗？抱歉。\n可是我真的想问怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e3102612b7e2aa36998cce3dc581dcb56b9631f8635b4a565fef2396221592fd", "ja": "えへへ。なんだかこの衣装が着たくなっちゃって、\nそれで、研究してたんですよ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，我突然莫名想穿这套服装，\n所以正在研究啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1006_p", "source_sha256": "bc61ccb762cded5d7520a20b414b967f800283c97437e6855800322ec819aa8f", "ja": "研究って、遊んでただけじゃないのか……。\nそんなに気に入ったのか？　その衣装。", "zh": "你说研究，原来不是单纯在玩吗……\n你就这么喜欢那套服装吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f76afd4a8583ec252dba370460408dab9f1a66fea57d96aa7183d4cb2522d599", "ja": "だって、わたしのPV用の衣装ですよ？\nそれって、{$P$}さんが……。", "zh": "因为这可是我的PV拍摄服装啊！\n意思就是，这是{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "00930ccd2ecfa9cb323d0fa3fc88bf8994be80b778d51c200bba1337b3fbf10f", "ja": "わたしのために、わたしのコトを考えて用意して\nくれたんでしょ？　うれしいに決まってますよ♪", "zh": "特地为了我、想着我而准备的对吧？\n我当然会很高兴呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f85715a8fdd86123ac1d2435577ea585266df21c4bb82821641d6bcbc6c09074", "ja": "だから今、わたしが一番かわいく見える\n角度を研究中なんで～す！　えへへ♪", "zh": "所以我正在研究要从哪个角度看，\n看起来才会最可爱～！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9037a940430426d1b9c2191e56cc4f52bc67d1928633ba68e022d50ffa55cf4a", "ja": "なるほど。翼がそんなふうに受け止めてくれたとは、\nプロデューサー冥利に尽きるな！", "zh": "原来是这样。你愿意这么想，\n我身为制作人真是再幸福不过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5f90d4511588d117f181be575bc375ec41d48e9aa76e3e1ee9fb085417eaf9e8", "ja": "もー、わたしのことなんだと思ってたんですか？\n{$P$}さんてば！", "zh": "讨厌～我在你心中是什么样子啦？\n{$P$}先生真是的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7ad0e312c572268abbaa1d705d5ffbd6d744f470bb58351c18e07f1711a12ef1", "ja": "せっかくやる気になったんだ。レッスンの方も\n頑張ってくれると嬉しいんだけど……。", "zh": "既然你好不容易提起干劲，\n要是训练课程也能努力，我会很高兴的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5c8fb6223052d993ef6869991c2b8f15b2de916970b5351af0cd1ac44996843c", "ja": "ふんふんふーん～♪", "zh": "哼哼哼──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c5e93b8fdf2c018b346cbfe489a8d94d589d48eae20d512e5070a4a429e87e4b", "ja": "翼……聞こえないフリしてごまかしてもダメだぞ。", "zh": "翼……想装做没听见蒙混过去也没用喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "124c6b6257e55569b972d4d1a68d27d662384fb2adfb16fc2867a3537c5b28b9", "ja": "だって、オシャレな衣装だから楽しいんですよ？\nレッスン着とか、地味だし……。", "zh": "可是我是因为穿上了时髦的服装才觉得开心啊！\n训练服那么朴素……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8d101bb3979c8c12d806974dde0f4998e369a7523577692fd7d510b06a3659f1", "ja": "じゃあ衣装を着てもいいって言ったら、\n真面目にレッスン受けるのか？", "zh": "那如果我说你可以穿着表演服装，\n你就会认真接受训练吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5f6f63dba7567c67762507357c0c17048e231bf15f08b3846bf53c8c11c6ea73", "ja": "えっ、衣装着ていいんですか！？　う～ん……でも\nやっぱり、カメラの前でポーズを決めるとかがいいな！", "zh": "咦，我可以穿着表演服装吗！？\n唔……不过还是在镜头前摆姿势之类的比较好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b340499a774de9150397e6477c1f117d42bba475c504163077367fc71592b55c", "ja": "{$P$}さんはカメラマン役で、\nわたしはいろんな衣装を着て……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生扮演摄影师，\n而我穿上各式各样的服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6b678ab201852a43cf6128846c64982f773d76f9cc2583efac8f630883e41f58", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、カワイイわたしを\nたくさん見れるし、そっちのほうがよくないですか♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生还能够看到\n我的各种可爱模样，这样不是更棒吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1020_p", "source_sha256": "d95c8f9b38321d39a8510ce440d171eec87e9c075d283079f3a0dc51f73d2cab", "ja": "いや……俺が言っているのは、\nもっと基礎的なレッスンのだな……。", "zh": "不……我在说的，\n是更基础的训练……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "67e596bcafea8841f7016fe69df05830a2d6ee721c82deacde43b18304eb0257", "ja": "え～。{$P$}さんは、\nわたしのカワイイところ見たくないんですか～？", "zh": "咦～{$P$}先生，\n你不想看到我可爱的一面吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0064_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1cbff8fa1a99fd5e27264a72449ce304c02baf8a867cf473c4f4e8730b82d335", "ja": "{$P$}さんなら、特別な\nわたしを見せてあげてもいいかな～……なんて♪", "zh": "如果是在{$P$}先生面前，\n我愿意展现特别的我……开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
